      "pinyin": "lǐ miàn de hàn zì dōu shì rì cháng shēng huó zhōng jīng cháng yòng dào de bǐ rú de yī wǒ yào",
      "english": ".. one foreign media company recently summarized 100 characters you must know to learn Chinese."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "他们还根据这些汉字的常用顺序，给这100个汉字排了序。",
      "traditional": "他們還根據這些漢字的常用順序，給這100個漢字排了序。",
      "pinyin": "tā men hái gēn jù zhè xiē hàn zì de cháng yòng shùn xù gěi zhè 2 ge hàn zì pái le xù",
      "english": "The characters are all commonly used in everyday life. For example: “de”, “yi”, “wo”, “yao” ..."
