      "Must-know 100 Chinese characters",
      "",
      "As the number of people who study Chinese increases, and Chinese becomes more and more popular, ..",
      ".. one foreign media company recently summarized 100 characters you must know to learn Chinese.",
      "The characters are all commonly used in everyday life. For example: “de”, “yi”, “wo”, “yao” ...",
      "They also ranked these 100 characters based on how common they are.",
      "The top 10 characters are, in order: “de”, “yi”, “shi”, “bu”, “le”, “zai”, “ren”, “you”, “wo”, “ta”.",
      "The bottom 10 characters are, in order: “ta”, “ben”, “qian”, “kai”, “dan”, “yin”, “zhi”, “cong”, “xiang”, “shi”.",
      "",
      "They say that based on this ranking, you only need to know the top 50 characters, ..",
      ".. and you can live in Beijing without any problems.",
